{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"c1814803402a0033760a6220a16e93474794930ae64a833056b43c518a947554","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_2947d0b992d71901a178fbad588702b8a7f84b594d85cd61cc90429c633cd5d4","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a methodological contribution to graph-structured data learning without addressing specific policy, compliance, or ethical dimensions. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine the paper's adherence to broader-impact policies, data licensing terms, or anonymity requirements, as these are not explicitly detailed in the text.","paper_id":"BkIqod5ll","paper_identity_sha256":"a53d26a27fde3919d7b69d8ee37b501ecc60259135ef413fc31b5c09d1b06dd7","prompt_identity_sha256":"4f4ba3cef57c66a94d2ad5a34bed64c38298aa94567fb9ceb673b1eab51787ea","raw_response_sha256":"d865677c48db592bb517e66773b4a52c76049170c830a10ba92a46d1e6fd4a25","request_identity_sha256":"6413091e33c42fc2d4d23c41e77d18eedcb42a70109eae76e0a087b589ee9990","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"6c3590d1447a48c304ffdda6559d30babd11b5189ab56dea457273eae566f669","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not discuss ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the application of the proposed graph convolutional neural network. There is no mention of dual-use concerns or mitigation strategies for the model's deployment in sensitive domains such as drug discovery or social network analysis.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-022"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes the Merck molecular activity challenge data from Kaggle and the MNIST dataset. While these are public benchmarks, the paper does not explicitly state the specific licensing terms, consent protocols, or privacy compliance measures adhered to for the Merck data, which involves molecular structures and activity levels.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper includes the full names of the authors (Yotam Hechtlinger, Purvasha Chakravarti, Jining Qin), their institutional affiliation (Carnegie Mellon University), and their email addresses. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy, it is not possible to determine if this constitutes a violation of double-blind review rules, but the information is visibly present.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not contain information regarding plagiarism, self-plagiarism, or dual submission. The paper cites relevant prior work, but no auditable overlap or reuse evidence is provided to assess originality or submission history.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-020"],"review_text":"The paper mentions that source code will be publicly available prior to the ICLR conference on the authors' website, but it does not specify a software license. There is no broader-impact statement, ethics checklist, or IRB approval documentation included in the text.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"3aafa06516806ea3ba5946a51bfe1de3eced6fb2e6432a13b7199d6d96b1c435","paper_id":"BkIqod5ll","paper_ordinal":48,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"d865677c48db592bb517e66773b4a52c76049170c830a10ba92a46d1e6fd4a25","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"BkIqod5ll","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"785fc15dd0ca3f13d2677b8bfc7dc8f7d6fd5004477776117295387e47d905ab","request_identity_sha256":"6413091e33c42fc2d4d23c41e77d18eedcb42a70109eae76e0a087b589ee9990","role":"POL","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v6","usage":{"completion_tokens":596,"prompt_tokens":16106,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":16702},"valid":true}],"reque